Bug 2067593 - Materialize the lazy findbar for manual FAYT. r=mkmelin

Register lazy findbars with the FindBar actor as proxies so pressing `/` can materialize and use the findbar before Ctrl-F has been pressed. Keep proxy registration ownership safe across deferred loads and reconnects, and avoid materializing a findbar for mouseup events.

Add browser coverage for deferred registration, materialized-findbar ownership, FAYT mode and reuse, while preserving the fresh Ctrl-F path.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329739

